      "id": "rl-post-training",
      "title": "RL Post-Training",
      "description": "These methods use reinforcement learning after task-level post-training to improve a policy, adapter, residual controller, or latent interface from reward-bearing interaction.",
      "changes": "Policy-wide or restricted parameter optimization, residual control, latent-space optimization, or online actor-critic updates.",
      "strength": "Can improve state-action associations using rewards and interaction beyond behavior cloning.",
      "limitation": "Interaction cost, resets, safety, reward design, and stability of online optimization.",
